When you recruit characters, like you're, you're starting, the, the, the, the starting characters, uh, have equipment already, but when you create characters, they have no equipment.

00:48:59.440 --> 00:49:00.560
You have to go buy some.

00:49:00.960 --> 00:49:10.460
