If you get the amulet, then they get some of that 50th K, you know?

00:49:37.240 --> 00:49:45.260
I like that there is a, uh, a lore, uh, to the, to the story because it is, it is honestly, it helps everybody.

00:49:45.320 --> 00:49:50.700
Okay. It makes the game more interesting because you're able to do more interesting things early on.

