00:49:57.120 --> 00:50:11.780
Uh, but no, seriously, like when you created a party of six and, uh, divvy the gold evenly between everybody, you've got about enough money to give everybody the most basic weapon, the most basic shield, and the most basic armor to them.

00:50:12.080 --> 00:50:26.400
Or you can just make sure that, uh, you know, three guys have some pretty awesome armor and, uh, and just wreck through the first, uh, level with pretty, uh, significant eats.

00:50:26.920 --> 00:50:28.280
Now, I didn't do that.

