00:50:41.480 --> 00:50:42.540
It wasn't an idea of mine.

00:50:42.820 --> 00:50:47.760
Just something in the, uh, you know, game FAQs section where you're like, huh.

00:50:48.420 --> 00:50:49.660
Make 20 characters.

